    <briefdescription>
<para>Unsupported gateway detection scenario for BPMN parser. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><bold>Input:</bold> BPMN with unsupported gateway types (COMPLEX_AND, COMPLEX_OR, etc.) <linebreak/>
 <bold>Expected Behavior:</bold> Explicit error before import; no silent accept <linebreak/>
 <bold>Trigger:</bold> <computeroutput>PROC_UNSUPPORTED_ELEMENT</computeroutput> with element details <linebreak/>
 <bold>Success Criteria:</bold><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Error code explicitly returned</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Unsupported element name is in error message</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No import of partially supported model</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Latency &lt;50 ms (P95) </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
